{"2531840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goeland: Seagull Adventure", "steam_appid": 2531840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.mp4?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The citizens of the island live a quiet life. Maybe a little too quiet...<br><br>Until you arrive. A curious and chaotic seagull with complete freedom to roam, explore, and cause a bit of trouble.<br><br>Will you help the locals... or drive them mad?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly freely around a vibrant island where nearly everything is interactive<br></li><li>Tease, prank, or assist citizens based on your mood<br></li><li>Solve playful challenges and uncover island secrets<br></li><li>Help animals in need and cross paths with them in unexpected ways<br></li><li>Go on treasure hunts by following maps and digging up hidden spots<br></li><li>Investigate a strange pollution threatening the island and try to fix it<br></li><li>Enjoy dynamic music that adapts to your behavior<br></li><li>Change the world, literally, through your actions<br></li><li>Or just perch on a bench and watch the world go by</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Goeland is a peaceful-yet-mischievous sandbox adventure where exploration, humor, and emergent gameplay collide.<br><br>Not a fan of chaos? Goeland lets you dial down the drama: disable chases, chill out, and just enjoy being a peaceful little bird.<br><br>What kind of seagull will you be?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/1844ae3e1be0e3e8e098f0607e6eec9c.mp4?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The citizens of the island live a quiet life. Maybe a little too quiet...<br><br>Until you arrive. A curious and chaotic seagull with complete freedom to roam, explore, and cause a bit of trouble.<br><br>Will you help the locals... or drive them mad?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/e253ee5217ff6edc707d93d9b485d4f7.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly freely around a vibrant island where nearly everything is interactive<br></li><li>Tease, prank, or assist citizens based on your mood<br></li><li>Solve playful challenges and uncover island secrets<br></li><li>Help animals in need and cross paths with them in unexpected ways<br></li><li>Go on treasure hunts by following maps and digging up hidden spots<br></li><li>Investigate a strange pollution threatening the island and try to fix it<br></li><li>Enjoy dynamic music that adapts to your behavior<br></li><li>Change the world, literally, through your actions<br></li><li>Or just perch on a bench and watch the world go by</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/36fed575245aa40344ade8176235926c.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Goeland is a peaceful-yet-mischievous sandbox adventure where exploration, humor, and emergent gameplay collide.<br><br>Not a fan of chaos? Goeland lets you dial down the drama: disable chases, chill out, and just enjoy being a peaceful little bird.<br><br>What kind of seagull will you be?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.poster.avif?t=1787782058\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/extras/d3e12bfa4a01723b35dff2084f168b3a.webm?t=1787782058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Be a chaotic seagull in a reactive sandbox world. Mess with everything, solve things your way, and create absurd moments worth sharing.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“Goeland is like Untitled Goose Game but you're a seagull [...] I'm looking forward to seeing what other chaotic things the developer adds in”<br>GamingOnLinux<br><br>“Forget angry geese and problematic pigeons, be the seagull and cause utter carnage beside the sea in the new Goeland demo”<br>GameSpace<br><br>“Goeland [...] this kind of no-stress game [...] to keep an eye on as it evolves”<br>ActuGaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/f4785e595def02c3a1f04cbd4044192dd0101c10/header.jpg?t=1787782058", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531840/75b505b5b9ff874e03cb6062ded524db0931958a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787782058", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste